<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #0B1220 0%, #16233D 100%)', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 5 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>DESIGN POINT 02 · 续</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.38)', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>· compaction 压缩</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>压缩是有损的，日志是无损的</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 516, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        {/* 左 */}
        <Box style={{ width: 612, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>两条触发路径</Text>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                {[
                    { k: 'threshold', t: '提前压', d: 'contextTokens > contextWindow − reserveTokens（默认 16384）', n: '下一次 assistant 请求前 / 每次 agent_end 后；不打断当前轮' },
                    { k: 'overflow', t: '事后压', d: 'provider 报 context overflow，或 stopReason = length 且可恢复', n: 'compact 后 continue() 恢复被打断的 turn；只重试一次' },
                ].map((c, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, paddingLeft: 13, paddingRight: 13, background: i === 0 ? 'rgba(42,212,238,0.09)' : 'rgba(22,35,61,0.72)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.20)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace', color: '#2AD4EE' }}>{c.k}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E8EEF9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{c.t}</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.72)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>{c.d}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.46)', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{c.n}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ marginTop: 16, fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>切点不是简单截断 · 三条边界规则</Text>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}>
                {[
                    ['01', '保住工作现场', '从最新消息向前累计 token，凑够 keepRecentTokens（默认 20000）处切开。'],
                    ['02', '只在合法切点切', 'user / assistant / bashExecution / custom 可以切，绝不在 toolResult 处切——工具结果必须紧跟它对应的调用。'],
                    ['03', '切在轮中要补前缀摘要', 'split turn 时对该轮前缀单独生成小摘要：Original Request / Early Progress / Context for Suffix，拼在主摘要之后。'],
                ].map((r, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 5, paddingBottom: 5, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.08)' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.62)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{r[0]}</Text>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>{r[1]}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ marginTop: 4, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>{r[2]}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 14, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.20)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>WRITE</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    .jsonl 不删任何条目，只追加一条 compaction entry（summary + firstKeptEntryId）——随时可回溯，甚至撤销压缩。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 右 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>结构化摘要 · 固定模板</Text>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.46)' }}>被丢弃的消息序列化进 &lt;conversation&gt; 标签，让 LLM 输出 checkpoint</Text>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                {[
                    ['## Goal', '这次任务要达成什么'],
                    ['## Constraints & Preferences', '约束、偏好、不能碰的东西'],
                    ['## Progress', 'Done / In Progress / Blocked'],
                    ['## Key Decisions', '做过哪些决定，为什么'],
                    ['## Next Steps', '下一步该干什么'],
                    ['## Critical Context', '路径、函数名、报错原文'],
                ].map((r, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6, paddingLeft: 10, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.60)', borderLeft: '2px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.34)' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 208, fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{r[0]}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)' }}>{r[1]}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 14, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.72)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.10)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#E8EEF9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>增量合并，不滚雪球</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.70)', lineHeight: 1.62 }}>
                    已有旧摘要时走 UPDATE prompt：PRESERVE all existing information，只把 In Progress 挪到 Done、刷新 Next Steps。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 8, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.70)', lineHeight: 1.62 }}>
                    模板硬性要求保真：Preserve exact file paths, function names, and error messages。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 8, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.70)', lineHeight: 1.62 }}>
                    文件清单兜底：从历史工具调用提取 readFiles / modifiedFiles，存进 entry 的 details，下次压缩继承。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 8, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.08)' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                        摘要调用失败或 stopReason = error / length → 拒绝落盘。半截摘要当 checkpoint 是灾难。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>从 LLM 到 Agent 再到 Pi Agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>29 / 46</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
